{"seq":2,"slug":"quantization","title":"模型量化与压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/quantization","wordCount":752,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型量化与压缩\">模型量化与压缩</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型量化是将模型参数从高精度数据类型（如 FP32/FP16）转换为低精度数据类型（如 INT8/INT4）的过程。量化后的模型显存占用更小、推理速度更快，使得在消费级硬件上部署大型 LLM 成为可能。量化是微调后部署的关键步骤，它在模型精度和推理效率之间寻找最优平衡点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[FP32 模型] --&gt;|Post-Training Quantization| B[INT8 模型]&#10;    A --&gt;|GPTQ| C[INT4 模型]&#10;    A --&gt;|AWQ| D[INT4 模型]&#10;    A --&gt;|GGUF| E[混合量化模型]&#10;    B --&gt; F[GPU 推理]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[CPU/GPU 推理]\">graph LR\n    A[FP32 模型] --&gt;|Post-Training Quantization| B[INT8 模型]\n    A --&gt;|GPTQ| C[INT4 模型]\n    A --&gt;|AWQ| D[INT4 模型]\n    A --&gt;|GGUF| E[混合量化模型]\n    B --&gt; F[GPU 推理]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[CPU/GPU 推理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化方法</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>显存节省</th>\n<th>速度提升</th>\n<th>质量损失</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP16</td>\n<td>16-bit</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>GPU 推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>1.5-2x</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPTQ</td>\n<td>4-bit</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>2-3x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>GPU 推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWQ</td>\n<td>4-bit</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>GPU 推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GGUF</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>6-10x</td>\n<td>1.5-3x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>CPU/混合推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bitsandbytes</td>\n<td>4/8-bit</td>\n<td>4-8x</td>\n<td>1-2x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>简单量化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gptq-量化\">GPTQ 量化</h2><p>GPTQ（Generative Pre-trained Transformer Quantization）是一种基于二阶信息的量化方法。它通过分析 Hessian 矩阵来确定最优的量化顺序和补偿策略，将精度损失降到最低：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, GPTQConfig&#10;&#10;model_name = &quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)&#10;&#10;quantization_config = GPTQConfig(&#10;    bits=4,&#10;    group_size=128,&#10;    desc_act=True,&#10;    dataset=&quot;c4&quot;,&#10;    tokenizer=tokenizer,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    model_name,&#10;    quantization_config=quantization_config,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model.save_pretrained(&quot;./model-gptq-4bit&quot;)&#10;tokenizer.save_pretrained(&quot;./model-gptq-4bit&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, GPTQConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"./fine-tuned-model\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantization_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GPTQConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    group_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    desc_act</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tokenizer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    quantization_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantization_config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.save_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./model-gptq-4bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer.save_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./model-gptq-4bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GPTQ 的关键参数是 <code>group_size</code>——它决定了多少个权重共享一个缩放因子。较小的 group_size（如 32-128）精度更高但量化后模型略大，较大的 group_size（如 1024）压缩更强但精度损失更大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"awq-量化\">AWQ 量化</h2><p>AWQ（Activation-aware Weight Quantization）基于一个关键观察：并非所有权重对模型输出的影响相同。AWQ 保留对激活值影响最大的权重通道（约 1%），对其使用更高精度，从而在相同的 bit 数下获得更好的质量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from awq import AutoAWQForCausalLM&#10;&#10;model = AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;)&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(&quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;)&#10;&#10;quant_config = {&#10;    &quot;zero_point&quot;: True,&#10;    &quot;q_group_size&quot;: 128,&#10;    &quot;w_bit&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;GEMM&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;model.quantize(tokenizer, quant_config=quant_config)&#10;model.save_quantized(&quot;./model-awq-4bit&quot;)&#10;tokenizer.save_pretrained(&quot;./model-awq-4bit&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoAWQForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./fine-tuned-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./fine-tuned-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quant_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"zero_point\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"q_group_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"w_bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GEMM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.quantize(tokenizer, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quant_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quant_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.save_quantized(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./model-awq-4bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer.save_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./model-awq-4bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>GPTQ</th>\n<th>AWQ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量化策略</td>\n<td>基于 Hessian 的最优量化顺序</td>\n<td>基于激活值的重要权重保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化速度</td>\n<td>较慢（需要校准数据）</td>\n<td>快（轻量级校准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>更快（GEMM 优化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度保持</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态支持</td>\n<td>广泛</td>\n<td>增长中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gguf-与-llama-cpp\">GGUF 与 llama.cpp</h2><p>GGUF 是 llama.cpp 生态使用的量化格式，支持在 CPU 上高效推理，也支持 GPU 加速。它使用多种量化策略的混合方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install llama-cpp-python&#10;&#10;python -m llama_cpp.llama_cpp \\&#10;  --model ./fine-tuned-model \\&#10;  --outtype q4_k_m \\&#10;  --outfile ./model.gguf\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> llama-cpp-python</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> llama_cpp.llama_cpp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --model</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./fine-tuned-model</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --outtype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> q4_k_m</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --outfile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./model.gguf</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GGUFQuantType {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  bitsPerWeight: number;&#10;  quality: string;&#10;  speed: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ggufTypes: GGUFQuantType[] = [&#10;  { name: &#39;Q2_K&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 2.6, quality: &#39;最低&#39;, speed: &#39;最快&#39; },&#10;  { name: &#39;Q3_K_M&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 3.1, quality: &#39;低&#39;, speed: &#39;很快&#39; },&#10;  { name: &#39;Q4_K_M&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 4.1, quality: &#39;良好&#39;, speed: &#39;快&#39; },&#10;  { name: &#39;Q5_K_M&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 5.1, quality: &#39;很好&#39;, speed: &#39;中&#39; },&#10;  { name: &#39;Q6_K&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 6.6, quality: &#39;接近 FP16&#39;, speed: &#39;较慢&#39; },&#10;  { name: &#39;Q8_0&#39;, bitsPerWeight: 8.5, quality: &#39;极好&#39;, speed: &#39;慢&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GGUFQuantType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bitsPerWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  speed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ggufTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GGUFQuantType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q2_K'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最低'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最快'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q3_K_M'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'低'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'很快'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q4_K_M'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'良好'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'快'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q5_K_M'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'很好'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q6_K'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'接近 FP16'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'较慢'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Q8_0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitsPerWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'极好'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, speed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'慢'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Q4_K_M 是最常用的量化级别，它在精度和压缩比之间取得了最佳平衡。对于大多数应用场景，Q4_K_M 的输出质量与 FP16 几乎无法区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化效果评估\">量化效果评估</h2><p>量化后必须验证模型质量没有显著下降。评估应覆盖通用基准和目标任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface QuantizationBenchmark {&#10;  metric: string;&#10;  fp16Score: number;&#10;  int8Score: number;&#10;  int4GptqScore: number;&#10;  int4AwqScore: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const benchmarks: QuantizationBenchmark[] = [&#10;  { metric: &#39;MMLU (5-shot)&#39;, fp16Score: 68.2, int8Score: 68.0, int4GptqScore: 67.1, int4AwqScore: 67.5 },&#10;  { metric: &#39;HellaSwag&#39;, fp16Score: 82.5, int8Score: 82.3, int4GptqScore: 81.4, int4AwqScore: 81.8 },&#10;  { metric: &#39;HumanEval&#39;, fp16Score: 45.0, int8Score: 44.5, int4GptqScore: 42.0, int4AwqScore: 43.5 },&#10;  { metric: &#39;Perplexity (PPL)&#39;, fp16Score: 5.2, int8Score: 5.3, int4GptqScore: 5.6, int4AwqScore: 5.4 },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QuantizationBenchmark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fp16Score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  int8Score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  int4GptqScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  int4AwqScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> benchmarks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QuantizationBenchmark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MMLU (5-shot)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fp16Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">68.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int8Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">68.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4GptqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">67.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4AwqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">67.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HellaSwag'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fp16Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">82.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int8Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">82.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4GptqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">81.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4AwqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">81.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HumanEval'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fp16Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int8Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4GptqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4AwqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">43.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Perplexity (PPL)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fp16Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int8Score: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4GptqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, int4AwqScore: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>量化质量的可接受标准：MMLU 等基准下降不超过 2%，Perplexity 增加不超过 10%，目标任务的关键指标下降不超过 3%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量化是微调后部署的关键步骤，在精度和效率之间寻找最优平衡</li>\n<li>GPTQ 使用 Hessian 信息优化量化顺序，AWQ 保护对激活值影响大的权重通道</li>\n<li>GGUF 格式支持 CPU 推理，Q4_K_M 是最通用的量化级别</li>\n<li>AWQ 在 4-bit 量化中通常表现最好，是 GPU 推理的首选</li>\n<li>量化后必须验证模型质量，可接受的精度下降范围为基准分数的 2-3%</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型量化与压缩","id":"模型量化与压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPTQ 量化","id":"gptq-量化"},{"level":2,"text":"AWQ 量化","id":"awq-量化"},{"level":2,"text":"GGUF 与 llama.cpp","id":"gguf-与-llama-cpp"},{"level":2,"text":"量化效果评估","id":"量化效果评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"微调评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/evaluation-methods"},"next":{"title":"模型服务化部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/model-serving"}}